    "单行：仅显示当前句。\n双行：显示当前句和下一句。\n多行：与完整尺寸相同，整页滚动显示歌词。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One Line: only the current line.\nTwo Lines: the current line and the next one.\nMulti-Line: a scrolling page of lyrics, like the full size."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "單行：僅顯示目前句。\n雙行：顯示目前句和下一句。\n多行：與完整尺寸相同，整頁捲動顯示歌詞。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "迷你尺寸仅显示当前句、显示当前句与下一句，或与完整尺寸相同整页滚动" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whether the mini size shows just the current line, the current and next line, or a scrolling page like the full size"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "迷你尺寸僅顯示目前句、顯示目前句與下一句，或與完整尺寸相同整頁捲動"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "作用于歌词、顶部信息和控制条；「自动」根据背景亮度在浅色与深色之间切换" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applies to the lyrics, header, and controls. Auto switches between light and dark based on the background's brightness."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作用於歌詞、頂部資訊和控制列；「自動」根據背景亮度在淺色與深色之間切換"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅作用于歌词；顶部信息和控制条仍用系统字体" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lyrics only; the header and controls keep the system font."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅作用於歌詞；頂部資訊和控制列仍用系統字體"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "歌词窗口的背景：跟随封面／纯色／渐变／毛玻璃" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The lyrics window's background: follow artwork, solid, gradient, or frosted glass"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "歌詞視窗的背景：跟隨封面／純色／漸層／毛玻璃"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "歌词窗口的文字颜色；「自动」根据背景亮度在浅色与深色之间切换" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The lyrics window's text color. Auto switches between light and dark based on the background's brightness."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "歌詞視窗的文字顏色；「自動」根據背景亮度在淺色與深色之間切換"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "迷你尺寸顶部显示歌名／歌手／专辑" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Show the title, artist, and album at the top of the mini size"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "迷你尺寸頂部顯示歌名／歌手／專輯"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅恢复迷你尺寸的设置，完整尺寸和窗口大小保持不变" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Resets only the Mini Size settings; the Full Size and the window's dimensions stay as they are"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅恢復迷你尺寸的設定，完整尺寸和視窗大小保持不變"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅恢复完整尺寸的设置，迷你尺寸和窗口大小保持不变" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Resets only the Full Size settings; the Mini Size and the window's dimensions stay as they are"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅恢復完整尺寸的設定，迷你尺寸和視窗大小保持不變"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "换行（默认）：一行显示不下时折行显示。\n滚动：每句只占一行，超出部分横向滚动；有逐字时间轴时随演唱进度滚动。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wrap (default): long lines fold onto the next line.\nScroll: every line stays one line tall and the overflow scrolls sideways — following the singing when the line has word-level timings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "換行（預設）：一行顯示不下時折行顯示。\n捲動：每句只佔一行，超出部分橫向捲動；有逐字時間軸時隨演唱進度捲動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "迷你尺寸中一行显示不下时换行或滚动" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whether long lines wrap or scroll in the mini size"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "迷你尺寸中一行顯示不下時換行或捲動"
