          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "行上按 %1$@ 次计，明细合计 %2$@ 次"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "列上以 %1$@ 次計，明細合計 %2$@ 次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两个数字来自 Last.fm 的两个接口：行上的次数由 track.getInfo（autocorrect）按写法族求和，明细由 user.getTrackScrobbles 按精确写法逐条列出。两者不一致通常是因为某种写法只在其中一边被合并" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The two numbers come from two Last.fm endpoints: the row sums track.getInfo (with autocorrect) over the spelling family, while the breakdown lists exact spellings via user.getTrackScrobbles. A gap usually means one spelling was merged on only one side"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "两个数字来自 Last.fm 的两个接口：行上的次数由 track.getInfo（autocorrect）按写法族求和，明细由 user.getTrackScrobbles 按精确写法逐条列出。两者不一致通常是因为某种写法只在其中一边被合并"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兩個數字來自 Last.fm 的兩個 API：行上的次數由 track.getInfo（autocorrect）按寫法族加總，明細由 user.getTrackScrobbles 按精確寫法逐筆列出。兩者不一致通常是因為某種寫法只在其中一邊被合併"
          }
        }
      }
    },
