    "YouTube Music 在浏览器中播放，Lyrimuse 需要知道是哪个浏览器才能读取播放进度。请选择常用的浏览器（可多选），随后系统会请求授权，选择允许即可；之后可在设置的「网页播放器」中更改" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "YouTube Music plays in a browser, so Lyrimuse needs to know which one to read the playback position from. Pick the ones you listen in (you can choose more than one); macOS then asks for permission, so choose Allow. You can change this later under Web Players in Settings"
