    "导出的文件包含账号凭证和密钥，请妥善保管，切勿分享。歌词库会另存为同名的第二个文件，迁移时需同时拷贝两个文件" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The exported file contains your account credentials and keys — keep it safe and do not share it. Your lyrics library is written as a second file with a matching name; copy both when migrating."
          }
