    "使用 Cloudflare Worker + KV 自行搭建的 state-worker 服务（独立公开仓库 Yudaotor/nowplaying-workers）。也可不自建：配置「ListenBrainz」后，网页同样能显示「正在播放」，两者配置其一即可。效果截图与完整搭建步骤见该仓库的 README" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A state-worker service you host yourself on Cloudflare Workers + KV (separate public repo: Yudaotor/nowplaying-workers). Self-hosting is optional: connecting “ListenBrainz” also lets the web page fall back to showing “Now Playing”, and either one alone is enough. That repo's own README has screenshots and full setup steps"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 Cloudflare Worker + KV 自行搭建的 state-worker 服务（独立公开仓库 Yudaotor/nowplaying-workers）。也可不自建：配置「ListenBrainz」后，网页同样能显示「正在播放」，两者配置其一即可。效果截图与完整搭建步骤见该仓库的 README"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 Cloudflare Worker + KV 自行架設的 state-worker 服務（獨立公開儲存庫 Yudaotor/nowplaying-workers）。也可不自行架設：設定「ListenBrainz」後，網頁同樣能顯示「正在播放」，兩者設定其一即可。效果截圖與完整架設步驟見該儲存庫的 README"
