    "勾选的播放器全部退出 5 秒后，Lyrimuse 随之退出；期间如有播放器重新打开则取消。设置、歌词管理或歌词窗口打开时，会等其关闭后再退出" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once every checked player has quit, Lyrimuse quits after a 5-second grace period; if any of them reopens in the meantime, the quit is cancelled. If Settings, Lyrics Manager or the lyrics window is open, it waits until they are closed"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "勾選的播放器全部結束 5 秒後，Lyrimuse 隨之結束；期間如有播放器重新開啟則取消。設定、歌詞管理或歌詞視窗開啟時，會等其關閉後再結束"
