    "歌曲无歌词或仍在搜索时，在歌词位置显示歌名，不收起为小图标；获取歌词后立即切换为歌词。暂停时仍收起为图标，广告期间不显示" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While a song has no lyrics or is still being searched, keep the lyrics slot with the song title instead of collapsing to the icon; the line is swapped in as soon as lyrics arrive. Still collapses when paused, and never shows during ads"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "歌曲無歌詞或仍在搜尋時，在歌詞位置顯示歌名，不收起為小圖像；取得歌詞後立即切換為歌詞。暫停時仍收起為圖像，廣告期間不顯示"
