          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统媒体信息通道在本机不可用，可能无法读取播放状态。仅有一种配置可绕过该通道：关闭「自动识别」并只勾选 Apple Music；其他配置均需通过该通道读取。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The system media info channel does not work on this Mac, so playback state may not be readable. Only one setup bypasses it: “Auto-detect” off with just Apple Music ticked. Every other setup reads through this channel."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系統媒體資訊通道在本機不可用，可能無法讀取播放狀態。僅有一種設定可繞過該通道：關閉「自動識別」並只勾選 Apple Music；其他設定均需透過該通道讀取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选择播放器" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
