            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Telegram, message @BotFather with /newbot to create a bot and paste the token it gives you into “Bot Token”. Then send your bot a message and open https://api.telegram.org/bot<your token>/getUpdates in a browser — the id under chat is your Chat ID"
