        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "輔助使用權限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请在系统设置的「辅助功能」中开启 Lyrimuse。如已授权但此处仍显示未授权，请将 Lyrimuse 取消勾选后重新勾选。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn on Lyrimuse under Accessibility in System Settings. If you granted it before and it still shows as not granted, uncheck Lyrimuse there and check it again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請在系統設定的「輔助使用」中開啟 Lyrimuse。如已授權但此處仍顯示未授權，請將 Lyrimuse 取消勾選後重新勾選。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 不向系统报告播放进度，Lyrimuse 会读取其界面上的播放时间来校准进度（仅读取，不会点按任何按钮）。不授权也可使用，但自动连播时进度可能偏差一到两秒。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ doesn't report its playback position to the system, so Lyrimuse reads the time shown in its window to keep lyrics in sync (read-only; it never clicks anything). It works without this too, but during autoplay the position can be off by a second or two."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 不向系統報告播放進度，Lyrimuse 會讀取其介面上的播放時間來校正進度（僅讀取，不會按下任何按鈕）。不授權也可使用，但自動連播時進度可能偏差一到兩秒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "辅助功能权限可让%@的播放进度更准确，仅读取其界面上的播放时间" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Accessibility keeps %@'s playback position accurate; it only reads the time shown in its window"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
